{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"The capt is quite flustered, trying to regain some aura of decorum","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:00:07.784000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737867025493393509","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"You are one of the few nobles aboard our fine vessel\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:00:28.949000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737867114265837658","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"Rigatony nods","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:00:40.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737867163892973568","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"While I do hope you are enjoying the voyage, I do hope you will be ready to take on some responsibility once we arrive in the new world.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:01:24.666000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737867347960004708","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"Please feel free to relax while aboard. But matters will begin to be serious.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:01:58.356000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737867489265975394","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"I was hoping to get all the highborn together and have a nice discussion, but is seems that they have made themselves scarce\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:02:38.595000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737867658040573962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"There are several matters of import, but I will address the most pressing ones for now so you can get back to the festivities.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:03:09.982000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737867789687193600","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"I was looking forward to the game you mentioned, but it seems as though we keep encountering difficulties\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:03:13.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737867803083800706","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"He nods, waiting","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:03:21.847000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737867839452479571","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"First and foremost is the matter of governance.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:03:48.259000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737867950232567918","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"While I have been granted authority by the crown while at sea, once we land, the people will need strong leadership from the aristocracy.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:04:40.405000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737868168948875295","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"It will fall on those with the means, education, and good sense to lead the others, lest we fall to our base desires.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:05:26.993000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737868364352978959","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"Rigatony nods. He should have known his responsibilities would catch up with him.","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:05:43.296000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737868432732586024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"What do you have in mind, captain?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:05:58.773000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737868497647828993","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"I have seen what happens to groups where a good leadership  is lacking. It's not pretty.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:06:27.925000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737868619920179230","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
