{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"I just hope that you will encourage your fellow nobles to take the reigns of command as we approach our destination.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:08:58.866000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737869253012619264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"While I understand your point on education, I would point out that where one is born does not impact their ability to lead... Though I will consider your veiwpoint\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:09:28.839000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-29T03:09:38.818000Z","id":"737869378728493107","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"My jurisdiction will fade once a mayor is chosen, and the success of our colony will greatly depend on your actions these next several days\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:09:42.189000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737869434722451456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"As long as you are aware, my mind will be put as ease.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:09:54.830000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737869487742648461","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"The next matter is that of economics\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:10:19.323000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737869590473867355","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"As a noble, you will have the responsibility of being patron to a merchant. It is important that you choose wisely. There are many talented merchants aboard. Have you considered who you would like to sponsor?\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:11:45.619000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737869952425656430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"Yes actually, I have begun my search\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:12:33.693000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737870154062495745","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"The Nobles with means will need to sponsor and guide the merchants as they help build a thriving settlement for the king and country.\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:12:39.121000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737870176829308940","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"737793687039377488","content":"\"It has been difficult, with the murder investigation and all. The last thing I would want to do is sponsor a member of the Golden Dawn\"","created_at":"2020-07-29T03:13:05.745000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737870288498458654","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
